      "seed": 820723767,
      "version": 691,
      "versionNonce": 1798726433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791571669495,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Route:\n1. check if current agent has access of the dept\n2. if not specified, use dept_router to find the most appropriate dept\n    - /harness/agents/dept_route.py\n        - + route()\n            - query\n        - look up in current dict / redis \n        - LLM to route \n            - self.llm.complete_json (httpx, not pi call) \n3. build context \n    - get previous context by session id from sessionstore\n    - collect implicit for improvement (follow up, same session)\n    - call memory_context_builder.build (see above, recall all memory)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 343,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Route:\n1. check if current agent has access of the dept\n2. if not specified, use dept_router to find the most appropriate dept\n    - /harness/agents/dept_route.py\n        - + route()\n            - query\n        - look up in current dict / redis \n        - LLM to route \n            - self.llm.complete_json (httpx, not pi call) \n3. build context \n    - get previous context by session id from sessionstore\n    - collect implicit for improvement (follow up, same session)\n    - call memory_context_builder.build (see above, recall all memory)\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
