      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "intent_agent: understand intent\n1. retrieve the memory\n2. intent_agent.infer() -> Intent (type, depts, user_role... raw(original response)\n    - query\n    - user_id\n    - memory: from 1\n    use pi, if no instance use python \n3. add to work memory\n\n    ",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
