    {
      "id": "bpxt2N0Z9ZfZU3MFse3Ox",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1895,
      "y": 1695,
      "width": 600.9595947265625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 535607087,
      "version": 442,
      "versionNonce": 1670417249,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791572233153,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. find matched hooks \n    - get depts (from intent.dept or from params\n    - evaluate\n        - return matched hooks based on trigger\n            - trigger is based on query and intent pattern  \n2. Apply the hooks \n    - mainly used for further improvement \n    - loop engine. apply \n3. rules \n    - rule_engine \n4. update the memory based on rules/hook",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 268,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. find matched hooks \n    - get depts (from intent.dept or from params\n    - evaluate\n        - return matched hooks based on trigger\n            - trigger is based on query and intent pattern  \n2. Apply the hooks \n    - mainly used for further improvement \n    - loop engine. apply \n3. rules \n    - rule_engine \n4. update the memory based on rules/hook",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
